Package: stemdeck
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, librubberband3, jack-example-tools, xdotool, x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, python3, onboard
Recommends: i3
Description: StemDeck, the stem player of the A3 system
 Four decks of stems over JACK, a FLAC recorder on the JACK inputs
 rec_L/rec_R, and the A3 beat clock. Runs as the systemd user unit
 stemdeck.service on i3 workspace 2.
 .
 User data stays when the package is removed or purged: the settings in
 ~/.config/StemDeck, the recordings in ~/.local/share/stemdeck, and the
 stem library wherever stemFolder names it.
